          "snippet": {
            "line": 193,
            "text": "theorem ge_line_of_rderiv_ge {v v' : ℝ → ℝ} {a b h m : ℝ}\n    (hv : ContinuousOn v (Icc a b))\n    (hv' : ∀ t ∈ Ico a b, HasDerivWithinAt v (v' t) (Ici t) t)\n    (hh : h ≤ v a) (hm : ∀ t ∈ Ico a b, -m ≤ v' t) :\n    ∀ t ∈ Icc a b, h - m * (t - a) ≤ v t := by"
          },
